     "content_type": "text",
     "parts": [
      "uist reviews are in. R2 says: \"The labeling procedure is underspecified. How were disagreements resolved, and is kappa computed before or after discussion? A kappa of 0.71 may be inflated if computed on adjudicated labels.\"\n\nwe computed it BEFORE discussion. draft a reply, max ~120 words, not defensive"
     ]
    },
