    "content": {
     "content_type": "text",
     "parts": [
      "Not really. It's the same course, a different offering. Call it what it is, which is still useful:\n\n> …a **cross-offering** analysis on a second semester of the course (different TAs and assignments)…\n\nIf a reviewer reads \"cross-course\" and later sees one course, that's a credibility hit at camera-ready time. \"Cross-offering\" plus an honest Limitations paragraph is the stronger move."
     ]
