     "parts": [
      "total rebuttal is at 5,410 chars and limit is 5,000. here are the 3 longest paragraphs, cut 410 chars total without dropping any promise\n\n[R2 para above]\n[R1 para with cross-offering]\n\"R3, privacy. We share R3's concern. All telemetry was collected under an IRB-approved protocol (#24-0917) with opt-in consent; 9 of 96 students declined and their data was never recorded. Data is stored on university servers, keystroke content is hashed for all non-code fields, and TAs in the study saw only pseudonymous IDs. We will add a dedicated paragraph on privacy and the risks of instructor-facing surveillance to the Discussion, and we will clarify that TutorTrace is not intended for grading.\""
     ]
